{"id":"c7vmnp9hrbnhasmzjl4jxgd9v","title":"阿拉斯加哀叹其珍稀鲑鱼种群的下降","originalTitle":"Alaska laments decline of its prized salmon populations","summary":"阿拉斯加渔民抱怨工业拖网渔船对鲑鱼种群的影响。十年间，捕捞量大幅减少，尤其是国王鲑鱼。渔民们认为这些大型拖网渔船在阿拉斯加海湾和白令海的捕捞活动导致了鲑鱼的大量死亡，而非返回河流产卵。气候变暖也被认为是导致鲑鱼种群下降的重要因素。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-alaska-laments-decline-prized-salmon.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T12:00:12.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T12:12:28.055Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T12:12:28.055Z","category":"clinical","tags":["研究成果"],"score":38,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"59c09768-20d6-4aa6-99cf-80adf9d6c212","title":"阿拉斯加渔民抗议拖网捕捞致鲑鱼种群锐减，气候变暖成关键因素"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"59c09768-20d6-4aa6-99cf-80adf9d6c212","title":"阿拉斯加渔民抗议拖网捕捞致鲑鱼种群锐减，气候变暖成关键因素"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fAp7kIzvq8RI","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}